#ASSERT `the conduct is a specified offence` `giving duty-free allowance goods to a friend in Singapore`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct is a specified offence` `consuming one's own duty-free allowance`
#ASSERT NOT `the conduct is a specified offence` `declaring and paying duty on excess goods`

